  "description": "If Claude Code keeps hitting usage limits, these three tricks make it run more efficiently and save tokens: the Opus plan model setting (Opus plans, Sonnet codes), the compact command to compress long chats, and the ultrathink keyword for complex tasks. Plus extra Claude Code tips to stop burning tokens.\n\nGet the full Claude Code efficiency guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ornu1DBK0TBTog1lWsK0aufS1elyoZid/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=110897400342351178452&rtpof=true&sd=true\n\n#Shorts #claudecode #ai",
